WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:04,310
Waiting for you

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:06,780
I'll find someone to ask

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,920
Did the province send a dog like you down? Who are you scolding?

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,220
Haven't left yet, haven't left yet

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,680
You and Niuniu stay here

6
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,840
No matter if there are gunshots or dead people above,

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,700
I won't speak. Don't come up. Where are you?

8
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,420
I have to figure out whether it's a human or a ghost outside.

9
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,730
Then you promise me

10
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,540
Don't risk your life

11
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,700
I still have to wait for our two boys to be born.
